<Base title="Credits & sources"><div class="page-shell"><PageHeading title="Made by a community." description="Artwork and writing provenance for this website."/><div class="prose"><h2>Game artwork</h2><p>The homepage shows a cropped screenshot of a running Globulation 2 match, provided by the project. The game page scene is the project’s screenshot, <code>data/screenshots/globulation2-gameplay.png</code>. The website uses a WebP-compressed copy. The original PNGs are also retained. Screenshots show the project’s original game artwork; no generated game imagery is used.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/Globulation2/glob2">Globulation 2 source repository</a> · <a href="https://github.com/Globulation2/glob2/blob/master/COPYING">Project license</a></p><h2>Legacy writing</h2><p>Guide and archive pages link to their original sources. Where reuse rights have not been established, this site provides a source link and an independently written summary rather than republishing the article.</p><a href="/archive/">Explore the archive →</a></div></div></Base>
